  "name": "Request for Quote",
  "description": "Let buyers request a quote: product or service, specifications, quantities, delivery location, required date and drawings.",
  "category": "Business",
  "seoTitle": "Free Request for Quote Form Template (RFQ)",
  "seoDescription": "Request for quote form template that collects buyer details, specifications, quantities, delivery address, target date and drawings so you can price jobs fast.",
  "keywords": [
